      <p class="banner-subtitle">A Windows desktop app that optimizes your PC for gaming. Sign in and toggle a catalogue of 525 Windows tweaks (registry, services, scheduled tasks, Store-app removal and power settings), plus a process viewer, app debloat, a per-app optimizer, FPS Boost, restore points, a startup manager, storage cleanup, network tools, a crosshair overlay and an NVIDIA driver profile for Fortnite.</p>
      <div class="banner-pills">
        <span class="title-tag">Windows 10 &amp; 11</span>
        <span class="title-tag" style="--color:#22c55e">Free tier</span>
        <span class="title-tag" style="--color:#3b82f6">Auto-updates</span>
      </div>
      <div class="banner-actions">
        <div class="nice-button-box"><a class="nice-button btn-lg" href="https://github.com/austins041/MizTweakz/releases/latest/download/MizTweakz-Setup.exe" data-download><i data-icon="download"></i><span>Download for <span class="free-word">Free</span></span></a></div>
        <a class="nice-button grey btn-lg" href="#utility-plans">See Plans</a>
      </div>
    </div>
